# Testing Conventions

- Unit tests: Vitest, files named *.test.ts
- E2E tests: Playwright, files named *.spec.ts
- Use describe/it blocks with clear, behavior-focused names
- Mock Prisma client using tests/helpers/mock-db.ts
- Mock auth sessions using tests/helpers/mock-auth.ts
- Prefer testing behavior over implementation details
- Target accessible selectors in E2E (role, label), not CSS classes
- Run unit: `npm run test`, E2E: `npm run test:e2e`
